      "statement": "execute_code runs generated Python in a fresh python -c subprocess whose GUARD prelude applies RLIMIT_AS/DATA/STACK to maximum_memory_bytes (default 256MB, skipped on macOS), disables exit/quit/help, replaces destructive os and shutil functions and subprocess.Popen with None, and blocks several modules via sys.modules.",
